a40000000007006379","IsParent":"parent-comment-66975752000000002300ef87","comment_content":"I think an AI's \"heart\" is our own echo chamber","comment_date":"07-17"},{"post_id":"6696958500000000250173e7","author_id":"56aa23d31c07df3c965c08e6","IsParent":"parent-comment-669738d6000000002600242e","comment_content":"对 是一种你自己和自己对话的反射。很多内心的力量只能来自自己","comment_date":"07-17"},{"post_id":"6696958500000000250173e7","author_id":"596f6c6150c4b43db5b52a66","IsParent":"parent-comment-6696fac1000000002300c26c","comment_content":"生成式人工智能也可能会有偏见，主要还是看拿什么数据去训练。你去玩玩豆包，把人气死。","comment_date":"07-17"},{"post_id":"6696958500000000250173e7","author_id":"5ac2b927e8ac2b7aba812f5e","IsParent":"parent-comment-66969b6c0000000026003e4a","comment_content":"抱抱姐姐","comment_date":"07-17"},{"post_id":"6696958500000000250173e7","author_id":"667727a40000000007006379","IsParent":"parent-comment-66975716000000001500847d","comment_content":"I ran to Caitlin Moran a few weeks ago. She told me that she is writing a novel about a few women who are disappointed in men and dating and decide to build the perfect boyfriend using Ai. I shared an anecdote and she said she will write it into her novel.","comment_date":"07-17"}]